And then at the end, `_diffAndEmit` does NOT call `_syncEnd` — the caller does. So the new `on Object { _syncEnd(); rethrow; }` catches throws from `_buildGrid`, `_detectScrollShift`, `_diffAndEmit`, `_emitScrollFrame` and closes the sync region. Good.

